{
  "name": "Add Pipedrive people with an Outbound label to an Argorant campaign",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Add Pipedrive people with an Outbound label to an Argorant campaign\n\n### How it works\nPlan in Pipedrive, send from Argorant. The Pipedrive Trigger fires when a person changes. If the person carries the label you set (for example Outbound), the workflow checks the primary email with Argorant. A valid address joins your campaign with first name, last name and organization as variables, and a note on the Pipedrive person says when and where it was added. Invalid addresses get a note too, so your team can fix them.\n\nCosts: half a credit per fresh email check.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Add a Pipedrive credential to **Person updated** and both note nodes.\n4. In **Settings**, set label_id to the ID of your Outbound label (Pipedrive: Settings, Labels).\n5. Pick the campaign in **Add to campaign** and activate.\n\n### Customization\nUse a custom field instead of a label, or add organizations by domain.",
        "height": 575,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "31776ddd-d55d-4998-86a2-70dcf0aed84a",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
